       CALL-ZCU00647-001.
               CALL 'ZCU00647' USING DFHCOMMAREA
                         WS-STATUS-CODE.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZCU00647 FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
